data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":81,"item_id":"rs_0bc0bbf1d30cf4d9016acadd756c38819390a58cf7f4d5e28c","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Testing migration strategies**\n\nI've got enough time to create a robust migration. I'm thinking of using SQLite to prepopulate the database before I start. It might be a good idea to separate the test migration from the existing tests to handle them better. I want to ensure we test all possible cases in one integration to cover everything. Let's see how that goes! This approach should make things smoother in the long run."}

